OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F388A1791402489
OL,3,CSouthampton FC charged with a breach
OL,4,Cof EFL regulations over alleged spying
OL,6,FSouthampton Football Club has been
OL,7,Fcharged with a breach of English
OL,8,FFootball League regulations and the
OL,9,Fmatter will be referred to an
OL,10,FIndependent Disciplinary Commission.
OL,12,FIt follows a complaint from
OL,13,FMiddlesbrough over alleged
OL,14,Funauthorised filming on private
OL,15,Fproperty, ahead of the two clubs
OL,16,Fmeeting in Saturday's Sky Bet
OL,17,FChampionship Play-Off Semi-Final First
OL,18,FLeg.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/8
