CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F388A1791402489
OL,3,CSouthampton FC charged with a breach
OL,4,Cof EFL regulations over alleged spying
OL,6,FThe Saints played Middlesbrough in the
OL,7,Ffirst leg of their Championship play-
OL,8,Foff semi final on Sarturday.
OL,10,FThe match ended in a goalless draw.
OL,12,FUnder EFL Regulations, Southampton
OL,13,Fwould ordinarily have 14 days to
OL,14,Frespond to the charges.
OL,16,FHowever, given the nature of the
OL,17,Fmatter, the EFL will ask the
OL,18,FIndependent Disciplinary Commission to
OL,19,Fshorten the response period and to
OL,20,Flist a hearing at the earliest
OL,21,Fopportunity.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
