FL,389,410,120,120,000,100
PN,38803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F388A1791402489
OL,3,CSouthampton FC charged with a breach
OL,4,Cof EFL regulations over alleged spying
OL,6,FThe League will make no further
OL,7,Fcomment whilst proceedings are ongoing.
OL,9,FYesterday, Middlesbrough made a
OL,10,Fcomplaint to the English Football
OL,11,FLeague (EFL), saying a Saints staff
OL,12,Fmember was spying on their training
OL,13,Fsession.
OL,15,FIt's alleged Southampton FC's
OL,16,Fperformance analyst was caught
OL,17,Frecording Boro training and taking
OL,18,Fpictures of tactics late on Thursday
OL,19,Fmorning.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng SportCWeatherFRewind
FL,389,410,120,120,000,100
PN,38804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F388A1791402489
OL,3,CSouthampton FC charged with a breach
OL,4,Cof EFL regulations over alleged spying
OL,6,FThe reports say he was caught, told to
OL,7,Fdelete the footage and leave the area.
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough then contacted the EFL
OL,9,Fto complain.
OL,11,FIn response, the English Football
OL,12,FLeague (EFL) issued a statement : "The
OL,13,Falleged incident is said to have taken
OL,14,Fplace on Middlesbrough's private
OL,15,Fproperty by an individual identified
OL,16,Fto be associated with Southampton.
OL,18,F"The League is treating this matter as
OL,19,Fpotential misconduct under EFL
OL,20,Fregulations and will be making no
OL,21,Ffurther comment at this time."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
