PN,38805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F388A1791402489
OL,3,CSouthampton FC charged with a breach
OL,4,Cof EFL regulations over alleged spying
OL,6,FSouthampton FC said "SFC acknowledges
OL,7,Fthe statement issued by the EFL in
OL,8,Frelation to alleged breaches of EFL
OL,9,FRegulations.
OL,11,F"We can confirm that we will be fully
OL,12,Fcooperating with the League throughout
OL,13,Fthis process.
OL,15,F"Given the ongoing nature of the
OL,16,Fmatter, the club is unable to comment
OL,17,Fany further at this time."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/8
