OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F388A1791402489
OL,3,CSouthampton FC charged with a breach
OL,4,Cof EFL regulations over alleged spying
OL,6,FIt's been dubbed Spygate 2.0 as it
OL,7,Ffollows similar allegations in 2019
OL,8,Fwhen a member of Leeds' staff was
OL,9,Ffound acting suspiciously outside
OL,10,FDerby's training ground.
OL,12,FBoss Marcelo Bielsa later revealed
OL,13,Fhe'd sent a member of staff to watch
OL,14,Ftraining sessions of every team Leeds
OL,15,Fplayed that season.
OL,17,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
