FL,389,410,120,120,000,100
PN,38807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F388A1791402489
OL,3,CSouthampton FC charged with a breach
OL,4,Cof EFL regulations over alleged spying
OL,6,FThe EFL found Leeds breached rules
OL,7,Fover treating teams with "good faith".
OL,9,FLeeds were fined #200,000. A rule was
OL,10,Fthen introduced - forbidding watching
OL,11,For filming opposition training up to
OL,12,F72 hours before a game.
OL,14,FIf charged, the matter will be handled
OL,15,Fby the EFL's disciplinary commission -
OL,16,Fan independent panel appointed through
OL,17,Findependent bodies to ensure
OL,18,Fneutrality.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
