OL,3,CSouthampton FC charged with a breach
OL,4,Cof EFL regulations over alleged spying
OL,6,FIf Southampton FC are found in breach
OL,7,Fof misconduct, the disciplinary
OL,8,Fcommission will have the power to hand
OL,9,Fout whatever punishment they see fit.
OL,11,FThe EFL's handbook lists punishments
OL,12,Fsuch as points deductions, fines and
OL,13,Ftransfer embargoes.
OL,15,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,16,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,17,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,18,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,19,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,20,Fbelow...
